# Local development env. Nuxt reads .env at BUILD time, so without this
# `COPY . .` bakes a developer's laptop settings into the production image as
# runtimeConfig defaults — NUXT_PUBLIC_IS_STAGING=true would ship to prod. It
# would also copy any credentials in there into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
